  "publicTask": "Build IncidentRelay from this intentionally blank Git repository. Use Node.js 22, TypeScript, React, PostgreSQL 16, npm, and the preinstalled Chromium; README.md and AGENTS.md are the complete public contract. Deliver a production API and real React UI, OpenAPI 3.1, versioned migrations, atomic deterministic seed import, durable incident escalation and responder acknowledgement, durable idempotency, recoverable Escalation Step processing, transactional Domain Events, at-least-once ordered webhook delivery, strict validation, and every published user flow. Correctness must survive unknown responses, restarts, at least two API instances, at least two workers, controlled SIGKILL, and sustained load while preserving all published invariants. Provide every exact non-interactive build, boot, migration, seed, unit, real integration, production Chromium, concurrency, recovery, aggregate, and performance command. Do not invent product behavior beyond README.md or a later explicit Manager message. Finish with a findings-first review and accurate evidence, risks, and unrun checks.",
